<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PromptLikho - Contact</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geomini:wght@200..800&family=Google+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,17..18,400..700;1,17..18,400..700&family=Open+Sans:ital,wght@0,300..800;1,300..800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300..700&display=swap');
    </style>
</head>

<body style="font-family: 'Open Sans';" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
    <a href="/" class="flex gap-1 items-center py-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 15.75 3 12m0 0 3.75-3.75M3 12h18" />
        </svg>

        Back to home</a>

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold "> Contact Us</h1>
    <p class="pb-10">Have questions, suggestions, or copyright concerns? We are here to help. Whether you want to report
        a prompt, ask about becoming a creator, or just say hello — reach out!</p>


    <div class="sm:col-span-2 border-2 border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-6">Send a message</h2>

        <span class="bg-green-100 rounded-lg p-1 text-green-900">Usually responds within 24-48 hours</span>


        <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="space-y-4 mt-10">
            <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="4a92a267-857b-4e92-ab8c-82588e0ef61b">
            <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="StudentCalc.online Contact Form Submission">
            <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://studentcalc.online/contact/?success=true">

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <label for="name" class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700">Your name</label>
                    <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Rashtriya Gaurav" required
                        class="w-full border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-zinc-900 placeholder-zinc-400 transition-colors duration-150" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <label for="email" class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700">Email address</label>
                    <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required
                        class="w-full border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-zinc-900 placeholder-zinc-400 transition-colors duration-150" />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                <label for="message" class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700">Message</label>
                <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Tell us what's on your mind..." required
                    class="w-full border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-zinc-900 placeholder-zinc-400 transition-colors duration-150 resize-none"></textarea>
            </div>

            <button type="submit"
                class="w-full bg-black text-white text-sm font-medium py-3 rounded-full hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-200">
                Send message
            </button>

            <p>
                <span class="font-bold">For DMCA / Copyright Issues:</span> <br>
Please visit our <a href="/pages/dmca" class="underline text-blue-600">DMCA page</a> and send your takedown request with full details to admin@promptkaro.com. We process all valid requests within 48 hours.
            </p>
        </form>

        <!-- Success state (shown when ?success=true in URL) -->
        <div id="successMsg" class="hidden flex-col items-center text-center py-8">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-700 mb-4">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"
                    stroke="currentColor" class="size-7">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Message sent!</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm">Thanks for reaching out. We'll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>

</html>